# Mau cau hinh - KHONG chua bi mat. Sao chep thanh .env (setup-db.ps1 se tu tao .env cho ban).
NODE_ENV=development
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=3000
# Mat khau phai duoc ma hoa URL (setup-db.ps1 lam viec nay). Tuyet doi khong dung tai khoan "postgres".
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://siscom_app:CHANGE_ME_NOT_A_REAL_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:5432/siscom_crm_dev?schema=public
SHADOW_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://siscom_app:CHANGE_ME_NOT_A_REAL_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:5432/siscom_crm_dev_shadow?schema=public
# B1.4 P3/P3b (S1 tach role, tuy chon tren Windows, BAT BUOC tren VPS): sau khi chay backend/docs/B1.3_S1_ROLE_SPLIT.sql.txt (superuser)
#   + B1.3_S1_APP_GRANTS_V2.sql.txt (siscom_migrator; quyen TOI THIEU cho siscom_app). KHONG chay B1.3_S1_APP_GRANTS.sql.txt (V1) nhu buoc
#   van hanh: V1 chi de ROLLBACK P3b co kiem soat (mo lai S2/S3); backend production se TU CHOI khoi dong khi phat hien quyen kieu V1.
#   Sau do,
#   lenh "prisma migrate deploy/status" va "npm run auth:bootstrap" dung role chu so huu siscom_migrator qua bien nay (UU TIEN hon DATABASE_URL khi dat).
#   Backend chay van CHI dung DATABASE_URL (siscom_app, chi DML). Chi dat TAM trong phien shell khi migrate; KHONG ghi vao .env cua dich vu.
#   CANH BAO: neu dat ca hai bien, chung PHAI tro cung host/cong/database; khac nhau => prisma/bootstrap tu choi (chong migrate nham DB).
#   KHONG bo comment dong duoi trong .env that: dotenv se nap no cho MOI lenh prisma, ke ca khi DATABASE_URL tro DB thu.
# MIGRATE_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://siscom_migrator:CHANGE_ME_NOT_A_REAL_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:5432/<cung ten DB voi DATABASE_URL>
# B1.4 P3c (pool XAC THUC rieng, dong S3): backend dung AUTH_DATABASE_URL (tai khoan siscom_auth, CUNG database voi DATABASE_URL, KHAC tai khoan)
#   cho dang nhap / phien / doi mat khau; DATABASE_URL (siscom_app) khong con doc hash, tao phien, goi ham doi mat khau (APP_GRANTS_V4; V3 truoc B3 A3).
#   production BAT BUOC dat (thieu => tu choi khoi dong); development/test thieu => dung chung DATABASE_URL (chi canh bao).
#   Tao role: backend/docs/B1.3_S1_AUTH_ROLE.sql.txt (superuser) roi B1.3_S1_APP_GRANTS_V4.sql.txt (migrator; V3 la ban rollback). Mat khau sinh tren may chu.
# AUTH_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://siscom_auth:CHANGE_ME_NOT_A_REAL_PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:5432/<cung ten DB voi DATABASE_URL>
# Chi cac dia chi frontend nay duoc goi API (dau phay ngan cach). Khong dung *
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
# error | warn | log | debug | verbose
LOG_LEVEL=log

# --- Xac thuc (B1.3.2). Goi A: chua bat buoc; bat buoc khi bat module auth (goi C) ---
# Khoa ky access JWT, toi thieu 32 byte ngau nhien. Sinh bang:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('base64url'))"
# JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
# Khoa cu khi quay vong (tuy chon, phai khac khoa hien tai)
# JWT_ACCESS_SECRET_PREV=
# Thoi han access token (giay, 60..3600) va phien refresh (ngay)
# ACCESS_TTL_SECONDS=600
# REFRESH_IDLE_DAYS=7
# REFRESH_ABS_DAYS=30
# Cookie refresh co co Secure (production bat buoc true)
# COOKIE_SECURE=true
# Origin duoc goi /auth/refresh, /auth/logout (mac dinh = CORS_ORIGINS). Khong dung *
# AUTH_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
# false | loopback | so hop 1..5 (khong dung true). B1.4 P1: ap dung that cho Express ('trust proxy') => han muc dang nhap /
# doi mat khau va tien to IP phien lay theo X-Forwarded-For do proxy duoc tin dat. Sau nginx cung may: loopback. Khong co proxy: false.
# TRUST_PROXY=false

# --- B1.3 MVP: phien cookie server-side (khong JWT). Mac dinh an toan; chi dat khi can doi ---
# SESSION_IDLE_MINUTES=480
# SESSION_ABS_HOURS=12
# LOGIN_WINDOW_MINUTES=15
# LOGIN_MAX_PER_SOURCE=30
# LOGIN_MAX_PER_IDENTIFIER=5
# LOGIN_LOCK_MINUTES=15
# LOGIN_LOCK_AFTER_FAILURES=5
# Khoi tao 4+1 tai khoan (chi DB THU, che do khoi tao): npm run build && npm run auth:bootstrap. Mat khau qua bien moi truong, KHONG ghi vao file:
# BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD_SYSADMIN= BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD_ADMIN= BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD_SALE= BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD_TECHNICIAN= BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD_ACCOUNTANT=

# --- FV-4A: xuat CSV khach hang (POST /customers/export) ---
# Thu muc ghi BEN nhat ky "bi bo qua" cua chuc nang xuat (file export-audit-gap-<ngay>.jsonl). Tai khoan chay backend phai tao/ghi duoc.
#   production BAT BUOC dat: thieu => backend TU CHOI khoi dong (fail-closed).
#   Moi moi truong: thu muc khong tao duoc, hoac co nhung KHONG GHI DUOC (thieu quyen, o day) => backend TU CHOI khoi dong.
#   development/test thieu => dung <thu muc tam he dieu hanh>/siscom-export-gap.
#   Dat ngoai thu muc ma nguon va ngoai thu muc web; dua vao sao luu. Chi tiet: docs/FV4_EXPORT_RUNBOOK.md
# EXPORT_GAP_LOG_DIR=D:\SISCOM-CRM-logs\export-gap
